---
const message = {
  title: '울림요가가 정식 오픈했어요',
};
---
<section class="closing-info page-shell" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
  <div class="closing-copy">
    <h2 id="closing-title">{message.title}</h2>
    <div class="closing-details">
      <p class="message-strip"><span>정식 오픈 혜택 · 2026.10.01–2026.10.10 클래스 패스 15% 할인</span></p>
      <p class="message-strip">2인 이상 동반 등록 시 해당 기간 할인가에서 추가 5% 할인</p>
    </div>

    <div class="closing-location" aria-label="울림요가 위치">
<address>경기도 성남시 중원구 둔촌대로113번길 8, 1층</address>
    </div>
    <section class="opening-hours" aria-labelledby="opening-hours-title">
      <h3 id="opening-hours-title">운영 안내</h3>
      <p>MON–FRI 13:00–22:00</p>
      <p>SAT–SUN 15:00–19:00</p>
      <p>공휴일 휴무</p>
    </section>

    <div class="closing-reservation">
      <button
        class="closing-reservation-trigger"
        type="button"
        aria-expanded="false"
        aria-controls="closing-reservation-panel"
      >
        상담 · 예약 문의 ↗
      </button>

      <div id="closing-reservation-panel" class="closing-reservation-panel" hidden>
        <p><strong>예약 페이지를 준비하고 있어요.</strong></p>
        <p>수업 및 예약 문의는<br />
          <span lang="en">Instagram DM</span> 또는 <a href="https://naver.me/5HyBanCi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">네이버 지도</a>에 표기된 연락처로 문자 남겨주세요.</p>
        <p>수업 중에는 전화 및 방문 상담이 어려울 수 있습니다.</p>
        <a
          lang="en"
          href="https://www.instagram.com/ullim.yoga/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >@ullim.yoga ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .closing-info {
    --strip-pink: #f7ecee;
    --strip-sage: #dce2d3;
    padding-block: clamp(88px, 9vw, 144px) clamp(144px, 15vw, 224px);
  }
  .closing-copy { width: 100%; max-width: 1040px; margin-inline: auto; }
  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 clamp(52px, 5.5vw, 78px);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-align: center;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 3.2vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    word-break: keep-all;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .closing-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: min(64vw, 880px);
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-inline: auto;
    isolation: isolate;
    padding: 12px 8px;
  }
  .message-strip {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 52px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 8px clamp(26px, 3vw, 44px);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.45vw, 19px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    text-align: center;
    word-break: keep-all;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .message-strip:first-child {
    width: min(46vw, 620px);
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: var(--color-burgundy);
    color: var(--strip-pink);
    transform: rotate(-.8deg);
  }
  .message-strip:last-child {
    z-index: 1;
    width: min(40vw, 550px);
    align-self: flex-end;
    margin-top: -14px;
    background: var(--strip-sage);
    color: var(--color-burgundy);
    transform: rotate(.7deg);
  }
  .closing-location {
    margin: clamp(38px, 4vw, 52px) auto 0;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .closing-location address {
    margin: 0;
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
    word-break: keep-all;
  }

  .closing-reservation {
    width: min(64vw, 880px);
    margin: 18px auto 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .opening-hours {
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 24px auto 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
    word-break: keep-all;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .opening-hours h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: inherit; font-weight: 400; }
  .opening-hours p { margin: 0; }

  .closing-reservation-trigger {
    padding: 3px 0;
    border: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    text-decoration: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font: 400 13px/1.6 var(--font-body);
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .closing-reservation-panel {
    width: min(420px, 100%);
    margin: 16px auto 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .closing-reservation-panel[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .closing-reservation-panel p {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
  }

  .closing-reservation-panel [lang='en'] { letter-spacing: .04em; }

  .closing-reservation-panel p a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .closing-reservation-panel strong {
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .closing-reservation-panel > a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 2px;
    color: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .closing-info { padding-block: 72px 128px; }
    h2 { margin-bottom: 52px; font-size: 30px; }
    .closing-details { width: 100%; max-width: 480px; margin-inline: auto; padding: 8px 3px; }
    .message-strip { min-height: 46px; padding: 8px 18px; font-size: clamp(14px, 3.6vw, 16px); line-height: 1.5; }
    .message-strip:first-child { width: 96%; }
    .message-strip:last-child { width: 86%; margin-top: -7px; padding-inline: 16px; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  const closingTrigger =
    document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.closing-reservation-trigger');
  const closingPanel =
    document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#closing-reservation-panel');

  closingTrigger?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (!closingPanel) return;

    const willOpen = closingPanel.hidden;
    closingPanel.hidden = !willOpen;
    closingTrigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(willOpen));
  });
</script>
